{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07296","headline":"送贾侍御克复後入京 · 刘长卿","name":"送贾侍御克复後入京","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"对酒心不乐，见君动行舟。\n回看暮帆隐，独向空江愁。\n晴云淡初夜，春塘深慢流。\n温颜风霜霁，喜气烟尘收。\n驰馹数千里，朝天十二楼。\n因之报亲爱，白发生沧洲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07296.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07296","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}